t%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8f3f1030d529cd294e76cb4f45759909, https://si.imgix.net/3f3bb7ef/uploads/origins/d72e2481-8243-45a0-9e02-4e4163a36ade?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=78e8be8c8b5f23f7d376e4292557c9e0 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3f3bb7ef/uploads/origins/d72e2481-8243-45a0-9e02-4e4163a36ade?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3ee59997e8dea66c19a80d5613f37ebc 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "rei様\n\n初めまして、水無月 柳菜(みなづき ゆうな)と申します\n\nアピールありがとうございます！\nデザインを気に入って頂けたようでとても嬉しく思います\n是非描いていただきたいと思い、リクエストを送らせていただきました\n\n衣装や表情、構図などはお任せいたします\nrei様の思うように描いていただければと！\n全身の資料は以下になります\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1y3YOxadzQn-6KDbBeHRFvMeoReiQCUFI?usp=sharing\n\n麻雀とマイクラと歌うことが好きな自称「神」です\nティアラと三つ編みがチャームポイント\n\n使用用途としては、配信でのサムネイルや、アイコン、ヘッダー等を考えています\nサムネイルに使用する都合上、背景透過があるととありがたいです(背景offできるpsdファイルでも〇)\n\n以上になります\nご検討のほどよろしくお願い致します", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@rei_yuri0/works/6", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/20021964/uploads/origins/ec355c0b-ede1-41a7-8c8e-d099843fdfaf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b8ad5fe4f5f354ef92aea0f54076d622", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/20021964/uploads/origins/ec355c0b-ede1-41a7-8c8e-d099843fdfaf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b8ad5fe4f5f354ef92aea0f54076d622, https://si.imgix.net/20021964/uploads/origins/ec355c0b-ede1-41a7-8c8e-d099843fdfaf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=82c16eefd2c89e88cad3e41e430f8801 2x, https://si.imgix.net/20021964/uploads/origins/ec355c0b-ede1-41a7-8c8e-d099843fdfaf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2062050a6f66d62cbce6cc73729030f0 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "はじめまして。\nアピールありがとうございます。\nそれではファイアーエムブレムのンンのイラストをリクエストさせていただければと思います。\nシチュエーション、衣装、背景含めて、お好きなように描いてくださって大丈夫です。\n参考までに、資料も添付しておきます。\n\n何か失礼や問題ありましたら申し訳ありません。\nよろしくお願いします。\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/2IEpsF1", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@rei_yuri0/works/5", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/76c0da90/uploads/origins/209bafe2-7eac-4d57-ab38-b93f301bacb5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bb3d78a371ab40f0e1e3db057bc5b3e1", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/76c0da90/uploads/origins/209bafe2-7eac-4d57-ab38-b93f301bacb5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bb3d78a371ab40f0e1e3db057bc5b3e1, https://si.imgix.net/76c0da90/uploads/origins/209bafe2-7eac-4d57-ab38-b93f301bacb5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8de9b7e0ba8ed8b7390249a735e8cbbe 2x, https://si.imgix.net/76c0da90/uploads/origins/209bafe2-7eac-4d57-ab38-b93f301bacb5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b01cacb1851ea4cc6c7aa0df3060480b 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hi, I really like your style; especially the hand-drawn marker pen style.\n\nCould I get a piece of my OC Rei. She spends most of her time playing video games and getting very angry at them. She also never takes her hoody off. Happy for you to do any pose and setting you like.\n\nRef sheet: https://reicha7.carrd.co/#ref\nother examples: https://reicha7.carrd.co/#gallery\n\nhttps://reicha7.carrd.co/#ref", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@rei_yuri0/works/4", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/7b742d19/uploads/origins/04be7c0c-3ae9-46f6-afe7-22f3100d21ac?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=31090df82d571edb2bb782df8cb015ad", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7b742d19/uploads/origins/04be7c0c-3ae9-46f6-afe7-22f3100d21ac?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=31090df82d571edb2bb782df8cb015ad, https://si.imgix.net/7b742d19/uploads/origins/04be7c0c-3ae9-46f6-afe7-22f3100d21ac?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=54410a4b22fea122ed67f4a5155115e0 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7b742d19/uploads/origins/04be7c0c-3ae9-46f6-afe7-22f3100d21ac?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=80350d4ac0a9a2bf37aff30bedd3acee 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは。アピール本当にありがとうございます。\nそれなら私のキャラクターを描いていただけますか。\n先生のスタイル通りに描いてください。\n衣装は好きなようにリチェンジしてもいいです。\n今まで私の文を読んでくださってありがとうございます.\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/D0NxsSl", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@rei_yuri0/works/3", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/adb9c9c3/uploads/origins/628d3311-e8bb-4c3a-a418-f672f813485d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3f6125fe2c681393508823103849d5f0", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/adb9c9c3/uploads/origins/628d3311-e8bb-4c3a-a418-f672f813485d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3f6125fe2c681393508823103849d5f0, https://si.imgix.net/adb9c9c3/uploads/origins/628d3311-e8bb-4c3a-a418-f672f813485d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5f4fba061d4fbe0256171adb9e6875f8 2x, https://si.imgix.net/adb9c9c3/uploads/origins/628d3311-e8bb-4c3a-a418-f672f813485d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b8bcfac8912ffd8bf7dbb0aa94bb8e84 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "はじめまして、アピールありがとうございます\n\nリクエストは\nキャラクターはうちの子・陽夜子(資料参考)で、シチュエーションはオープンカフェでメロンクリームソーダを美味しそうに飲んでいる。\n陽夜子の持っている日傘は畳んでいる状態でお願いします。\n\n背景、構図、ポーズ、すべてお任せします。\n\n以上、宜しくお願いします\n\nhttps://twitter.com/barrel_sake2020/status/1527238709690503170", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@rei_yuri0/works/2", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/f3dfc2b3/uploads/origins/97a24c51-e9b4-49fd-805b-4d988230292a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6b84c0bc9af7c254ef2aed62520778bc", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f3dfc2b3/uploads/origins/97a24c51-e9b4-49fd-805b-4d988230292a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6b84c0bc9af7c254ef2aed62520778bc, https://si.imgix.net/f3dfc2b3/uploads/origins/97a24c51-e9b4-49fd-805b-4d988230292a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2685f4f95a281e49ef8ca6cf1d0f521e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f3dfc2b3/uploads/origins/97a24c51-e9b4-49fd-805b-4d988230292a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f040f6f8198dbcabcbb78906f57cc037 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Nice to meet you rei! Thank you for your appeal.\nPlease let me make a request!\n\nCould you draw a character from the browser game \"Alice Mystiria! I would like to draw a character from the browser game \"Alice Mystiria!\n\nPlease feel free to draw the character you would like to draw the most in both composition and costume.\nPlease feel free to draw the character you would like to draw the most in both composition and costume.\nYou can find some full-length portraits of the characters in the [Sacred Costume] button on the character page.\nYou can see some full-body portraits of the characters in the \"Sacred Costume\" button.\n\nhttps://dmm-imys.com/character/\n\nOfficial guidelines for Airis Mystiria\nhttps://august-soft.com/about/fanfic_guideline/\n(To summarize, Aimis is officially allowed to create derivative works.\n　You can skip this section if you like.)\n\nThank you for your consideration of the above.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@rei_yuri0/works/1", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/bb66e225/uploads/origins/19417b36-05ae-4ab3-b6fb-038d5d4e6965?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f0ac55e515bf82841848117169f5ccc7", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/bb66e225/uploads/origins/19417b36-05ae-4ab3-b6fb-038d5d4e6965?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f0ac55e515bf82841848117169f5ccc7, https://si.imgix.net/bb66e225/uploads/origins/19417b36-05ae-4ab3-b6fb-038d5d4e6965?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1e300190f86dd61a848917426748a2a6 2x, https://si.imgix.net/bb66e225/uploads/origins/19417b36-05ae-4ab3-b6fb-038d5d4e6965?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=11438b648d518d4fa5df13ca50c4844c 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Thanks for the appeal!\nWe are glad you liked our characters!\nWe'd love to have you illustrate our boy!\n\nI would like to leave everything to you, including the composition.\nYou may rearrange the clothing and other details to make it easier for us to draw.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/14kkIvCLbXOwVFEYduRke7ewmpn4SkUkG/view?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}]}